{
  "_comment": "Apply these on first start with: scripts/bootstrap-opensearch.sh, or call the OS bootstrap API once the cluster is green.  |  ts is declared explicitly (2026-07-21, DEF-6): it was previously left to dynamic mapping, which inferred `date` from the first integer seen and then rejected every float epoch-seconds value, silently dropping ~10k events/day. The router normalises ts to integer epoch-millis; this mapping pins that contract.",
  "_comment_lane_coverage": "F-06/F-15/F-53 (2026-07-21): there are SIX log lanes on the bus but only three templates existed (applogs/syslog/flows). snmptrap + cloudlogs were 100% dynamically mapped, so after the DEF-6 fix started emitting `ts` as an integer they would have inferred `long` instead of `date` — date-range queries, the Dashboards time picker and any sort on ts then silently misbehave. netops-snmptrap ALSO had no template at all, so number_of_replicas defaulted to 1 on a single-node cluster, its replica sat UNASSIGNED forever, and the cluster was permanently yellow — which destroys yellow as a usable alarm signal. Every template here therefore pins number_of_replicas: 0 (single-node appliance; see F-07 for the production posture note) and declares the shared field contract.",
  "templates": {
    "netops-applogs": {
      "index_patterns": [
        "netops-applogs-*"
      ],
      "template": {
        "settings": {
          "number_of_shards": 1,
          "number_of_replicas": 0,
          "codec": "best_compression",
          "refresh_interval": "5s"
        },
        "mappings": {
          "properties": {
            "timestamp": {
              "type": "date"
            },
            "level": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "component": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "service": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "container_name": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "message": {
              "type": "text"
            },
            "msg": {
              "type": "text"
            },
            "tenant_id": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "ts": {
              "type": "date",
              "format": "strict_date_optional_time||epoch_millis"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "netops-syslog": {
      "index_patterns": [
        "netops-syslog-*"
      ],
      "template": {
        "settings": {
          "number_of_shards": 1,
          "number_of_replicas": 0,
          "codec": "best_compression",
          "refresh_interval": "5s"
        },
        "mappings": {
          "properties": {
            "timestamp": {
              "type": "date"
            },
            "hostname": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "appname": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "severity": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "facility": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "message": {
              "type": "text"
            },
            "tenant_id": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "ts": {
              "type": "date",
              "format": "strict_date_optional_time||epoch_millis"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "netops-flows": {
      "index_patterns": [
        "netops-flows-*"
      ],
      "template": {
        "settings": {
          "number_of_shards": 1,
          "number_of_replicas": 0,
          "codec": "best_compression",
          "refresh_interval": "10s"
        },
        "mappings": {
          "properties": {
            "timestamp": {
              "type": "date"
            },
            "sampler_address": {
              "type": "ip"
            },
            "src_addr": {
              "type": "ip"
            },
            "dst_addr": {
              "type": "ip"
            },
            "src_port": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "dst_port": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "proto": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "bytes": {
              "type": "long"
            },
            "packets": {
              "type": "long"
            },
            "tenant_id": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "ts": {
              "type": "date",
              "format": "strict_date_optional_time||epoch_millis"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "netops-snmptrap": {
      "_comment": "F-53/F-06: this lane had NO template. Consequences fixed here: (1) number_of_replicas defaulted to 1 -> permanently UNASSIGNED replica -> permanently yellow cluster; (2) `ts` would map as long, not date; (3) `varbinds` is vendor-controlled free-form input and was fully dynamically mapped, so a trap storm from a new vendor could type-poison the index or walk it into the 1000-field wall. varbinds is stored but NOT indexed (enabled:false) - searchable-by-document, un-mappable-by-vendor.",
      "index_patterns": [
        "netops-snmptrap-*"
      ],
      "template": {
        "settings": {
          "number_of_shards": 1,
          "number_of_replicas": 0,
          "codec": "best_compression",
          "refresh_interval": "5s",
          "mapping": {
            "total_fields": {
              "limit": 1000
            },
            "ignore_malformed": true
          }
        },
        "mappings": {
          "properties": {
            "timestamp": {
              "type": "date"
            },
            "device": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "host": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "hostname": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "source_address": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "trap_oid": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "severity": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "message": {
              "type": "text"
            },
            "tenant_id": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "varbinds": {
              "type": "object",
              "enabled": false
            },
            "ts": {
              "type": "date",
              "format": "strict_date_optional_time||epoch_millis"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "netops-cloudlogs": {
      "_comment": "F-06/F-15: cloud log lane, previously untemplated. Same shared contract; cloud_family/cloud_provider/resource_id are the lane's routing keys.",
      "index_patterns": [
        "netops-cloudlogs-*"
      ],
      "template": {
        "settings": {
          "number_of_shards": 1,
          "number_of_replicas": 0,
          "codec": "best_compression",
          "refresh_interval": "5s",
          "mapping": {
            "total_fields": {
              "limit": 1000
            },
            "ignore_malformed": true
          }
        },
        "mappings": {
          "properties": {
            "timestamp": {
              "type": "date"
            },
            "cloud_family": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "cloud_provider": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "resource_id": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "account": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "region": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "host": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "app": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "level": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "severity": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "source_type": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "signal": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "message": {
              "type": "text"
            },
            "tenant_id": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "ts": {
              "type": "date",
              "format": "strict_date_optional_time||epoch_millis"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "netops-deadletter": {
      "_comment": "The dead-letter lane is deliberately flat: dropped_at/lane/reason/raw only, raw being an encoded JSON STRING. A dead-letter index that can itself reject a document is worthless, so nothing here is dynamically typed.",
      "index_patterns": [
        "netops-deadletter-*"
      ],
      "template": {
        "settings": {
          "number_of_shards": 1,
          "number_of_replicas": 0,
          "codec": "best_compression",
          "refresh_interval": "5s"
        },
        "mappings": {
          "dynamic": false,
          "properties": {
            "dropped_at": {
              "type": "date",
              "format": "strict_date_optional_time||epoch_millis"
            },
            "lane": {
              "type": "keyword"
            },
            "reason": {
              "type": "text"
            },
            "raw": {
              "type": "text",
              "index": false
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
